        "geometry_type": "real",
        "digitized_from": "DataSF Assessor parcels (acdm-wktn), lot 8709007 (mapped 2001-03-20; active); the earlier outline came from: DataSF Building Footprints (mblr SF8709007); name/address from OpenStreetMap way 27955297 (1700 Owens St)",
        "digitization_method": "ADDED 2026-09-19 for Mission Bay's third real-buildings pass (remaining uncovered footprints inside the official Mission Bay North/South redevelopment-area boundary): 1700 Owens St, a UCSF-affiliated research building at the west corner of Owens Street housing the UCSF-Bay Area Center for AIDS Research (CFAR) and the Taube-Koret Center for Huntington's Disease Research. 2026-09-29 accuracy audit: tenant sourcing: the CFAR page cited above is only an event-location tag listing CFAR events held at 1700 Owens Street, so it does not show that CFAR is housed there, and 'UCSF-affiliated' rests on those events plus the Assessor/permit record (the permit calls it a research and development building). The Taube-Koret Center for Huntington's Disease Research is a Gladstone Institutes program (established March 2009); Gladstone's own center site has a contact page, undated, that lists it as 'located in the 1700 building' at 1700 Owens Street, now cited; whether it is still there is not confirmed. 2026-10-02: public-text pass. accuracy_caveat, notes reworded for readers (meaning unchanged; no change to the shape, status, use or geometry_type); previous wording -- accuracy_caveat: 'REAL -- surveyed DataSF Building Footprints outline (mblr SF8709007), cross-referenced by position against an OpenStreetMap building/address point (way 27955297) for the name and street address; not a hand trace or plan estimate. Construction date: DBI permit 200412282235 (research and development building at 1700 Owens) completed 2007-10-02 and the Assessor roll for 2009-2021 gives year built 2007; architect not confirmed by any source found in this pass.'; notes: 'Construction: DBI permit 200412282235 completed 2007-10-02 and Assessor year built 2007 (roll years 2009-2021); architect not confirmed by any source found in this pass.'. 2026-10-10 link fix: the Gladstone contact page cited for the Taube-Koret Center's location is gone (HTTP 404, no web-archive copy), so that citation was dropped and the record no longer says the Center is in this building; the building's use as research space rests on the DBI permit and Assessor entries above. The geometry is unchanged. REPLACED 2026-10-12 (shape; status and use unchanged): the owner approved building records whose outline matches an Assessor lot at 85% or better, both ways, using the lot (CLAUDE.md, 'An official parcel beats our drawing'). DataSF's Assessor layer (data/raw/parcels.geojson) has Assessor lot 8709007 (3,991 m2, active, mapped 2001-03-20); the earlier outline of 3,371 m2 and the lot overlap with IoU 0.82 (99% of the earlier outline lies inside the lot and it covers 83% of the lot). The outline is now that lot using the lots' own vertices (no simplification). geometry_type stays 'real'. Previous digitized_from: 'DataSF Building Footprints (mblr SF8709007); name/address from OpenStreetMap way 27955297 (1700 Owens St)'. Previous accuracy_caveat: 'REAL -- surveyed DataSF Building Footprints outline (mblr SF8709007), cross-referenced by position against an OpenStreetMap building/address point (way 27955297) for the name and street address; not a hand trace or plan estimate. Construction date: DBI permit 200412282235 (research and development building at 1700 Owens) completed 2007-10-02 and the Assessor roll for 2009-2021 gives year built 2007; architect not confirmed by any source found.'.",
        "accuracy_caveat": "REAL lot geometry -- the outline is Assessor lot 8709007 (3,991 m2, active), so its edges are recorded lot lines, not a surveyed building footprint: it includes any yard, setback or plaza inside the lot and can sit a little off the walls. Until 2026-10-12 this record showed the surveyed building footprint (DataSF Building Footprints (mblr SF8709007)); 99% of that outline lies inside the lot and it covered 83% of the lot.",
        "notes": "Construction: DBI permit 200412282235 completed 2007-10-02 and Assessor year built 2007 (roll years 2009-2021); architect not confirmed by any source found.",
